OL,5,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,6,     FCerys welcomes Lina Palera to
OL,7,     Fexplore ancient Greek music, soil
OL,8,     Fecologist Frank Ashwood on the
OL,9,     Fhidden world beneath our feet, and
OL,10,     FJason Singh on the wonder of
OL,11,     Fstarling murmurations.
OL,12,G1300 Bobby Friction's Finest Hour
OL,13,     FBobby Friction brings his
OL,14,     Fgenre-hopping musical taste to
OL,15,     FSunday afternoons.
OL,16,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,17,     FJarvis marks the posthumous
OL,18,     Fbirthday of folk collector and
OL,19,     Farchivist Cecil Sharp. He also
OL,20,     Fdusts off some random vinyl he'd
OL,21,     Fleft up north.
